    kind: "fix",
    body: "The % stop mask added to .console-destinations ul is measured against the\nul's own box; every row is absolutely positioned, so the ul is zero-height\nand the whole column was masked out (the residual selection light sat\nunmasked next to it). Move the fade to .console-menu, the box that really\ncovers the screen: rows dissolve toward the footer, the cross and every\ncategory stay in the fully opaque top, and nothing intersects the footer.\n\nVerified: tsc clean, build green (single index.html), jsdom harness\n24/24 (rows + icons + labels + bodies for all six categories, board,\noptions, system view, chrome), exact-geometry check 79/79 across\n1920x1080 / 1366x768 / 1280x720 / 1167x782 / 390x844.\n\nCo-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>",
